  "text": "Planning Document: docs/dcps/INNERWEST/Marrickville/Marrickville DCP 2011 - 9 33 Princes Highway.pdf\n\nClause 9.33.2 - heritage (heritage): To protect and preserve the identified period buildings within the precinct and \nencourage their sympathetic alteration or restoration.\n\nClause 9.33.2 - heritage (heritage): To protect the identified  Heritage Items  within the precinct.\n\nClause 9.33.2 - heritage (heritage): To protect  significant streetscape s and/or public domai n elements within the \nprecinct.\n\nClause 9.33.2 - parking (development_control): To ensure that the provision and location of of f-street car parking does not \nadversely impact the amenity of the precinct.\n\nClause 9.33.2 - land_use_zoning (land_use_zoning): To protect existing industrial lands required to service Sydney Airport and Port Botany.\n\nClause 9.33.2 - other (development_control): To ensure that any new development does not negatively impact on the operation of the Princes Highway.\n\n",
